  "bhubaneswar": {"localContext":"Bhubaneswar — 'Temple City' aur Odisha ki planned capital, jahan Lingaraja jaise ancient temples aur Infocity ka IT corridor saath-saath chalte hain. Jayadev Vihar aur Chandrasekharpur ki modern colonies ek tezi se badalti professional lifestyle dikhati hain. Yahan IT professionals, students aur working women ke beech discreet, safe companionship ki demand grow kar rahi hai.","areaNotes":["Jayadev Vihar — prime upscale junction; hotels, malls aur offices yahin","Chandrasekharpur & Sailashree Vihar — IT corridor ke paas, modern residential, privacy zyada","Patia — Infocity aur universities ke paas, students aur young professionals ka hub","Saheed Nagar — central residential-cum-commercial, accessible first-meet ke liye","Nayapalli — planned mid-city pocket, well-connected","Old Town — historic temple area, congested par culturally rich"],"tips":["Pehli meeting ke liye Ekamra Kanan botanical garden ka relaxed setting accha","Discreet check-in ke liye Jayadev Vihar ke business hotels (Mayfair, Swosti) practical","Esplanade One Mall casual public meeting point ke liye safe aur central"],"faqs":[{"q":"Bhubaneswar me sabse zyada discreet booking kahan hoti hai?","a":"Chandrasekharpur aur Sailashree Vihar jaise IT-corridor residential areas me privacy sabse zyada."}]},
